---
import UtilityLayout from "../layouts/utility-layout.astro"
import { SITE_DISPLAY_NAME } from "@/lib/site-url"

const pageTitle = `Account Services & Resources | ${SITE_DISPLAY_NAME}`
const pageDescription = `Explore the services and account workflows available through EBC Flex.`
---

<UtilityLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} pageName="Services" canonicalPath="/services">
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <div class="border-b border-[var(--layout-border)] pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)] tracking-tight mb-3">Account Services</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-[var(--layout-muted)] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Everything you can do with your spending accounts in the portal.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-[var(--layout-text)] leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Claims &amp; Reimbursements</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Submit claims:</strong> file reimbursement claims with itemized receipts and track them while they are reviewed.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Direct deposit:</strong> receive approved reimbursements straight to your bank account.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Receipt upload:</strong> photograph and upload documentation to substantiate card purchases.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Claim history:</strong> review past claims, decisions, and payment details in one record.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Cards &amp; Payments</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Benefits debit card:</strong> activate a new card and use it for eligible expenses wherever cards are accepted.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Card controls:</strong> review transactions and report a card that is lost or damaged.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-[var(--layout-text)]">Balances:</strong> see current balances for every account at a glance.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Account Management</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        Update contact and banking details, review eligible expense lists, and check the deadlines
        that apply to your plan — including year-end FSA submission windows and HSA contribution
        limits published each year.
      </p>
    </div>
        <div class="text-xs text-[var(--layout-muted)] bg-[var(--layout-card-subtle)] p-4 rounded-md border border-[var(--layout-border)] leading-relaxed">
      Availability of specific features varies by account type and plan. Sign in for details that
      apply to you, or contact member support with questions.
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Self-Service, Any Time</h2>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Every workflow in the portal is designed to be completed on your own schedule. Tasks that once
      required forms and phone calls now finish in minutes, with confirmation at each step and a
      record of what was submitted. When a request needs review, the portal shows the status so you
      are never left guessing where things stand.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Because these tools are available around the clock, you can handle time-sensitive matters
      without waiting for business hours. Guidance is built into each flow, and help is close by if
      a step is unclear.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      The service catalog grows as needs evolve. Features are added based on the questions and
      requests members bring to support, so if a tool you expect is missing today it may well be on
      the way. Feedback through the Contact page directly shapes what gets built next.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Visit the Resources page for guides covering each workflow in depth, or head to the FAQ for
      quick answers to common questions about how these services work day to day.
    </p>
  </div>
</UtilityLayout>
